<ModMetaData>
  <name>Genesis</name>
  <author>Cruesoe</author>
  <packageId>cruesoe.genesis</packageId>
  <supportedVersions>
    <li>1.6</li>
  </supportedVersions>
  <description>A progression overhaul built around the Vanilla Expanded series.

Research moves through the eras, from tribal beginnings to spacer technology, with fewer and bigger projects. Each one unlocks a whole family of related items across your mods, so everything from the same stage arrives together. Finishing an era's capstone project advances your colony to the next era.

Works with any mix of the supported mods; each is only touched when it's active.

Replaces the Progression and ProgressionLESS mods; do not use them together.</description>
